OL,3,GNEWSAEngland's largest donor centre
OL,4,A'major milestone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngland's largest doner centre has
OL,7,Fopened in Reading, becoming the first
OL,8,Fto receive blood, plasma and platelet
OL,9,Fdonations under one roof.
OL,11,FNHS Blood and Transplant's (NHSBT) said
OL,12,Fthe centre, which will be open six days
OL,13,Fa week, was a "major milestone" in its
OL,14,Fblood supply and plasma resilience
OL,15,Fstrategy.
OL,17,FIt opened for plasma donations on 12
OL,18,FOctober, whole blood collections will
OL,19,Fbegin on 19 October, and platelet
OL,20,Fcollections will follow by the end of
OL,21,Fthe year.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
