OL,3,GNEWSAEngland's largest donor centre
OL,4,A'major milestone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLee Wright, operational support lead,
OL,7,Fsaid: "We're looking to replicate this
OL,8,Ftype of thing across the country over
OL,9,Fthe next few years."
